; ==============================================================================
;  config\menus\session-startmenu.rc  -  shared by the themes; no look here (icons come from variables
;  each theme defines: IconLock, IconLogoff, IconRestart, IconShutdown; empty = no icon).
;  Lock, sign out, restart, shut down. Variant for *PopupStartMenu; menus\session.rc has the same entries for *Popup.
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it. Menus cannot be extended
;  from personal.rc (it is read before the theme; see AGENTS.md section 5).
; ==============================================================================
*PopupStartMenu .icon="$IconLock$" "Bloquear" !Execute [rundll32.exe user32.dll,LockWorkStation]
*PopupStartMenu .icon="$IconLogoff$" "Cerrar sesión" !Logoff
*PopupStartMenu .icon="$IconRestart$" "Reiniciar" !Execute [shutdown.exe /r /t 0]
*PopupStartMenu .icon="$IconShutdown$" "Apagar" !Execute [shutdown.exe /s /t 0]
